        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ab’i Kiriyati‐yeyarimu baraza, bajana isandugu y’ Uhoraho, bayidūgana umusozi, bayishira kwa Abinadabu; maze barobanura umuhungu wiwe Eleyazari, kugira ngw abe ari we ayizezwa.",
