        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva ku musi iyo sandugu yashikiye i Kiriyati‐yeyarimu hashira igihe kirekire, nk’imyaka mirongwibiri; ab’ inzu y’Abisirayeli bose barondera Uhoraho batuntuye. ",
