        {
          "text": "Maze Samweli abarira ab’ inzu y’Abisirayeli bose, ati Ni mwaba mugarutse k’Uhoraho n’ imitima yanyu yose, ni mukūreh’ ibigirwamana vy’abanyamahanga na Ashitaroti biri muri mwebge, muherereze imitima yanyu k’Uhoraho, abe ari we musaba wenyene, na we azobarokora, abakūre mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abisirayeli baca bakūraho za Bayali na Ashitaroti, basaba Uhoraho wenyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
