            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bakoranira i Misipa, bavoma amazi, bayavyagiza imbere y’Uhoraho; uwo musi barisonzesha, baravuga, bati Twaracumuye k’Uhoraho. Maze Samweli acīrira Abisirayeli imanza aho nyene i Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisitiya bumvise kw Abisirayeli bakoraniye i Misipa, abaganwa babo baca badūga kubatera. Abisirayeli bavyumvise, bagira ubgoba kubg’ Abafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.12.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 12:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli babarira Samweli, bati Ntuhengeshanye kudutakambira k’Uhoraho Imana yacu, kugira ngw adukize, ntidukorokere mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.99.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 99:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Samweli yābīra umwagazi w’intama uconka, awushikanira Uhoraho kw ikimazi co kwoswa kidasonōye; maze Samweli atakambira Uhoraho kubg’ Abisirayeli; Uhoraho aramwumvira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
