            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibisagara vy’ Abisirayeli vyari vyaranyazwe n’ Abafilisitiya barabisubizwa, uhereye i Ekuroni ugashitsa i Gati, mber’ Abisirayeli bakūra igihugu cabo mu bubasha bg’Abafilisitiya. Ariko hagati y’Abisirayeli n’Abamori ho hār’ impore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
